lse,"description":"Yugabyte SQL (YSQL)"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"mbautin","id":552936,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjkzNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/552936?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin","html_url":"https://github.com/mbautin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"mbautin","id":552936,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjkzNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/552936?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin","html_url":"https://github.com/mbautin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2019-05-31T15:56:42Z","updated_at":"2022-07-09T01:01:26Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-1804](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-1804)\r\nThis was discovered when org.yb.pgsql.TestPgTransactions.testBasicTransaction started failing at serializable isolation (which was the default isolation in our Java tests for a while) starting with https://github.com/YugaByte/yugabyte-db/commit/1553aeb762b7c122d886111d123ecbbcebc5c70f , where the default partitioning was switched from hash to range, and it stopped failing when we changed the default back to hash-partitioning in https://github.com/YugaByte/yugabyte-db/commit/b9a7f457f52c7f6655ffd3ddc256f93835370558. It turned out that this test not failing the way it's written at SERIALIZABLE level is a bug. The test does the following:\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nSTART TRANSACTION ISOLATION LEVEL SERIALIZABLE\r\nINSERT INTO test(h, r, v) VALUES (0, 2, 3);\r\n```\r\nand in another session\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nSTART TRANSACTION ISOLATION LEVEL SERIALIZABLE\r\nSELECT h, r, v FROM test WHERE h = 0;\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith our current implementation of SERIALIZABLE (based on optimistic strict two-phase locking), the two statements above should already be in conflict. Also this conflict is expected only assuming that the second transaction is not being done in a read-only mode, in which no read lock (read intent) on the predicate would have to be taken.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1465/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1465/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}